<title>USA: Noven Pharmaceuticals Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Noven Pharmaceuticals Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  March 31,</p>
<p>						  1997		1996</p>
<p> Total revenues			 1,681,279	 5,554,525</p>
<p> Net loss			     (2,759,609)	 (619,924)</p>
<p> Net loss per share			 (.14)	     (.03)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares of common</p>
<p>  stock				  19,883,435	19,756,549</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 net loss is attributable to its licensing partners' deferrment of reorders until the second half of the year.</p>
<p>Full name is Noven Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
